      "sourceTextSha256": "b993e3c9cfad89f3c3021fa0339ad41c7adc54f11693742c6285579578054bbd",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. At the appointed time, Transfer to Foz do Iguaçu Airport for your flight to Campo Grande. Transfer to Bonito\n\nBonito is one of the most popular ecotourism destinations in Brazil. Only in a few places in the world has nature been preserved in such pristine beauty. Bonito is a unique place where centuries-old forests coexist with stalactite and stalagmite caves, magnificent waterfalls and exotic fish in the clear waters of the rivers.\n\nOvernight at Arte da Natureza Hotel Bonito, Premium, BB",
